MeshStandardMaterial aur MeshPhysicalMaterial mein roughnessMap ke jaise texture properties hoti hain:

Property -	Kis cheez ko control karti hai

map	--             --Surface ka color/texture
roughnessMap--	   --Surface kitni rough ya smooth dikhe
metalnessMap--	   --Surface kitni metallic dikhe
normalMap--        --Chhoti surface details ka illusion
aoMap--	           --Creases/corners mein soft shadowing
bumpMap--	      --Bina geometry badle surface bumps ka illusion
displacementMap	-- --Texture ke basis par actual geometry ko displace kare
emissiveMap	--     --Surface ke glow/emission ka pattern
alphaMap--	       --Surface ki transparency ka pattern


bas muje batao kya karna hai tum kuch mat karo